  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 71538442a108cf245bf5b66c9780c8da, type: 3}
  m_Name: Monk
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: Unknown
  speakerNameVietnamese: 
  speakerAvatar: {fileID: 0}
  lines:
  - Poor child...
  - Look at what humanity has done to you.
  - But do not hate them.
  - For the path ahead is filled with nothing but monsters.
  - I can only pray that, somehow, you will find peace.
  vietnameseLines:
  - "Th\u1EADt \u0111\xE1ng th\u01B0\u01A1ng... c\u1EADu b\xE9 t\u1ED9i nghi\u1EC7p."
  - "H\xE3y nh\xECn xem lo\xE0i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1ED1i x\u1EED
    v\u1EDBi ng\u01B0\u01A1i nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF n\xE0o."
  - "Nh\u01B0ng con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc c\xF2n t\xE0n kh\u1ED1c
    h\u01A1n th\u1EBF."
  - "N\u01A1i \u1EA5y ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 qu\xE1i v\u1EADt \u0111ang ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1EE3i."
  - "C\u1EA7u mong s\u1ED1 ph\u1EADn s\u1EBD m\u1EC9m c\u01B0\u1EDDi v\u1EDBi ng\u01B0\u01A1i."
